==Overview==
=== Format ===
* 10 teams participate
* Two groups based on the results of [[LCK/2026 Season/Rounds 1-2|Rounds 1-2]]
* Teams carry over their records from [[LCK/2026 Season/Rounds 1-2|Rounds 1-2]]
* Double Round Robin within group
* All matches are best of three
* Top four teams from the Legend Group qualify for [[LCK/2026 Season/Season Playoffs|Season Playoffs]]
* Bottom team from Legend Group and top 3 teams from the Rise Group qualify for [[LCK/2026 Season/Season Play-In|Season Play-In]]

